OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school hit by targeted
OL,4,Acyber-attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school has been hit by a
OL,7,Ftargeted cyber-attack, a council has
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FBristol City Council said records at
OL,11,FSouthville Primary School were exported
OL,12,Ffrom its management information system
OL,13,Fduring the attack.
OL,15,FThe council said it believed the attack
OL,16,Fwas "carried out by the same criminals"
OL,17,Fwho targeted its system it uses to
OL,18,Fmanage the schools it runs last month,
OL,19,Fbut added that had not been confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
